title: Raritan PX2/PX3: PDU Outlet Pole Measurements
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the electrical measurements of individual outlet conductors
 from the PDU2-MIB outletPoleSensorMeasurementsTable. Each sensor uses its own
 scaling and state. Whole-outlet readings and output summaries remain independent.

item:
 The outletLabel, {{Phase}} and the actual outletPoleLine, for example
 {{O3 Phase L1}} or {{3 Phase N}}. The service prefix is {{Output}}.
 Missing labels use {{Outlet <ID>}} and missing line assignments use {{Pole <index>}}.
 Multiple PDUs and repeated labels or lines include indices to avoid collisions.

discovery:
 One service per outlet pole with supported electrical measurements.
